{"2764370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starward", "steam_appid": 2764370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>【Binary Star and the Black Wing】Version 3.2 Info Summary</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/f991496f106a11df81b5422a44d348c6.avif?t=1787539729\" width=1080 height=6200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starward Version 3.2 has arrived! A brand-new collaboration begins, alongside the Ruin Treasure Hunt event, and Ether's new swimsuit skin! Unlock the new character &quot;Binary Star&quot; Reah and Phoebe's new Season Pass swimsuit skin &quot;Adventure to Seaside&quot; !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starward is a 3D fighting game that integrates mecha girls and classic GVG combat gameplay, with 1V1 and 2V2 mode as the core gameplay. In Starward, players can control mecha girls with distinct personalities and different combat styles, and experience three-dimensional combat experiences beyond the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/eb04527d8955f4de78bbe6ee689cd0f5.poster.avif?t=1787539729\" width=1170 height=836 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/eb04527d8955f4de78bbe6ee689cd0f5.webm?t=1787539729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/eb04527d8955f4de78bbe6ee689cd0f5.mp4?t=1787539729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/af3bfca461b4706e9b285ff5326452ca.poster.avif?t=1787539729\" width=1170 height=836 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/af3bfca461b4706e9b285ff5326452ca.webm?t=1787539729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/af3bfca461b4706e9b285ff5326452ca.mp4?t=1787539729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/25896b0d785adfc150bc2f0fa18903af.poster.avif?t=1787539729\" width=1170 height=736 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/25896b0d785adfc150bc2f0fa18903af.webm?t=1787539729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/25896b0d785adfc150bc2f0fa18903af.mp4?t=1787539729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun in Starward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starward Version 3.2 has arrived! A brand-new collaboration begins, alongside the Ruin Treasure Hunt event, and Ether's new swimsuit skin! Unlock the new character &quot;Binary Star&quot; Reah and Phoebe's new Season Pass swimsuit skin &quot;Adventure to Seaside&quot; !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starward is a 3D fighting game that integrates mecha girls and classic GVG combat gameplay, with 1V1 and 2V2 mode as the core gameplay. In Starward, players can control mecha girls with distinct personalities and different combat styles, and experience three-dimensional combat experiences beyond the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap